{"v":4,"catch":"「逃走」與「救援」──在遠海孤島上描繪的二種截然不同的恐怖。","desc":"「Revelations」系列為描繪「Resident Evil」系列空白部分的作品。\n\n第二部作品所描繪的是於《Resident Evil 5》和《Resident Evil 6》之間發生的兩個恐怖事件：\n被囚禁於遠海孤島的Claire與Moira之逃離故事；前往拯救她們的Barry與在島上遇見的少女Natalia之探索之旅。\n\n極受玩家好評的Raid 模式也大幅增加了內容，可充分享受砍殺類遊戲的趣味。\nNintendo Switch™版更追加了獨有的直感式操作方式，可作出「直接瞄準敵人」和「揮舞小刀」等動作。\n\n※本作亦支援波蘭語。","publisher":"CAPCOM","release":"2025-09-09","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1–2 人 · 本機通訊 1–2 人 · 網路 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","葡萄牙文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","俄文","韓文","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"限制級","size":"Switch 2 25.4GB / Switch 25.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ab181d3458bf86c90c5c47ae037ceb29d9a52277eebd07f1d98a5eff1511ae74.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d080a6eccc7c1071b46d59b1d394352a9d8d3ecf1679df77722c4fd15d5c5d72.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/486f974abf096e2f1ad806f96434ac528aef83f07755270bc551d8dbda6d159b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c8dd1f103a0494d8f775b1cb82af718a243ef4baf3688dfb1ea01c7305ff871.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/22eac4a2ae4caa3818d798925d2a60f9379a833e1140b8aef48a5b6f06ec3f23.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5216f24968dae16cd0274803f17fcd675bb99482230101aaa38d01fc873552a5.jpg"],"titleId":"010095300212a000","dlc":[]}